OL,3,GNEWSARoman settlement dating back 2,000
OL,4,Ayears found under new-build estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of brooches and moulds have
OL,7,Fundergone conservation and will be
OL,8,Ffurther analysed at the National Museum
OL,9,Fof Wales in Cardiff before going on
OL,10,Fdisplay in north-east Wales.
OL,12,FProject manager Chris Matthews, said
OL,13,Fthe find was "very exciting" and it
OL,14,Fchanged what was understood about the
OL,15,Fhistory of the area.
